- \( a + d + e + g = 195 \)
- \( b + d + f + g = 367 \)
- \( c + e + f + g = 562 \)

Adding these equations:
- \( (a + b + c) + (d + e + f) + 3g = 195 + 367 + 562 \)
- \( 437 + 234 + 3g = 1124 \)
- \( 671 + 3g = 1124 \)
- \( 3g = 453 \)
- \( g = 151 \)

Thus, the number of residents who own all four things is \(\boxed{151}\). 53%|█████▎    | 16/30 [1:07:07<39:27, 169.10s/it]
