\[
\sum_{a \in A} 2^{a - 1} = 2024
\]

We convert 2024 into its binary representation to find the sum of powers of 2. The binary representation of 2024 is \( 11111101000 \), which corresponds to the sum of \( 2^{10} + 2^9 + 2^8 + 2^7 + 2^6 + 2^5 + 2^3 \).

